 "text": "Press Alt+1 for screen-reader mode, Alt+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window D3 Meet Us Services Our Work Blog Careers Contact Us REQUEST A QUOTE Multimedia Multimedia Services & Local Production Experts In today’s fast-moving and digital world, users expect more than static content—they expect experiences. Multimedia incorporates video, photography, animation, audio, and graphics to create a variety of ways your audience can connect with your brand. While content may be king, dynamic, high-quality multimedia content is what truly sets you apart. D3’s multimedia services help you tell your story, showcase your team, and make your message clear with custom production. These professional assets of staff headshots and onsite photography, or training videos, customer testimonials, motion graphics, and branded video content all work to support your marketing goals. D3’s Photo & Video Production Video Production and Editing We love to capture brand stories, product creation, testimonials, and high-quality training content. Video also includes short-form B-roll that builds your media library for a variety of marketing channels. Photography Our team will come to visit, capturing the essence of your business. Get professional staff headshots, lifestyle imagery, or event coverage that represents your brand and people in the best light. Drone Photo and Video D3 multimedia specialists are equipped with advanced photo and video equipment that includes drone licenses. Animation and Motion Graphics Explain, engage, and enhance your digital presence with the creative animation skills of D3’s multimedia team. Audio and Voiceover Services Professional-quality audio that adds polish and clarity to your multimedia projects. Custom Graphics and Visual Design As always, your assets are branded cohesively, making each piece of content recognizable and your own. Why Invest in Multimedia Services for Your Marketing? Build a versatile content library for marketing channels Boost engagement on digital platforms Strengthen your brand Stand out from your competition Why Choose D3 for Marketing Photo & Video? Full media ownership Long-term partnerships Customized strategy End-to-end service, from creative concept to final edits Ready to upgrade your content strategy with D3’s engaging multimedia? Let’s create something that stands out! Case Studies Dynamic Multimedia Assets That Deliver CRABS TO GO Crabs To Go, a long-time local favorite for fresh, carry-out seafood, needed a modern website to match their year-round demand and new payment processing system. By uniting web, social, and creative efforts, we delivered a cohesive, high-performing site that immediately increased online orders and better reflects the quality and character of this community staple. VIEW CASE STUDY ZEN SPA & STUDIO Z Zen Spa, nestled along the coast of Delaware, offers a peaceful escape from daily life with a wide array of services dedicated to rejuvenation and wellness for both locals and visitors to the area. The spa specializes in personalized massage therapies, advanced skincare treatments, and restorative body treatments that combine traditional techniques with modern wellness practices. With a focus on holistic health and a serene ambiance, Zen Spa provides a sanctuary where guests can relax, recharge, and... VIEW CASE STUDY OLD PRO GOLF Old Pro Golf has been delighting families in Ocean City, MD, since 1963. D3 helped bring their iconic courses into the modern era with a refreshed brand, vibrant photography, a dynamic new website, and playful social storytelling. From immersive course visuals to an online scorecard and streamlined event booking, every touchpoint celebrates nostalgia while engaging a new generation of mini-golfers. VIEW CASE STUDY CASTLE IN THE SAND HOTEL The Castle in the Sand Hotel has been an iconic Ocean City, MD destination for generations. Owned and operated by the Showell family, the hotel is known for its stunning oceanfront location, close to all the action, its variety of accommodations, and its family-friendly atmosphere. VIEW CASE STUDY JOLLY ROGER AMUSEMENTS A familiar legend, newly charted: D3 reimagined Jolly Roger® Amusement Parks, a beloved Ocean City, MD brand, for a new generation of visitors. Over the years, Jolly Roger’s digital presence had expanded across multiple sister websites representing all of its parks and attractions. We envisioned a solution to reduce complexity from both a management and maintenance perspective, and to modernize the famed amusement park’s brand presence. VIEW CASE STUDY THE LAND GROUP For Ben Alder, founder of The Land Group, land isn’t just a transaction; it’s a long-term asset, an ecological resource, and a part of who he is. The company needed a website that reflected this philosophy, while also functioning as a powerful tool for buyers, sellers, and stakeholders to explore properties and understand the deeper mission behind their work. Previous attempts to build custom features, especially an interactive land mapping tool, had fallen short. The Land Group... VIEW CASE STUDY BOARDWALK HOTEL GROUP Building on a long-standing relationship, D3 led a comprehensive overhaul of Boardwalk Hotel Group’s four websites, refreshing photography and video, restructuring and streamlining extensive content, and updating design to better meet evolving guest expectations. The project showcased our project management strength and expertise while integrating seamlessly with ongoing marketing efforts to ensure cohesion across all initiatives. The result is a modern, unified website experience that maintains strong search performance, aligns with industry standards, and continues to drive... VIEW CASE STUDY PRIMO FAMILY RESTAURANT After a longstanding relationship with D3 for website hosting, Primo Family Restaurant partnered with our team to reimagine their digital presence and unify their marketing efforts into a cohesive, growth-focused strategy. Our goal was to create a digital experience that reflects the same quality, warmth, and authenticity guests enjoy in person. Through a comprehensive marketing initiative, including a new website and professional photography, social media and email marketing support, lead capture, and digital advertising, D3 brought Primo’s... VIEW CASE STUDY 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 Tell Your Story With D3’s Photo and Video Services Submit the form below, or give us a call at 410-213-2400 First Name Last Name Company Name Phone Email How Did You Hear About D3? How Did You Hear About D3?* Google Search Social Media Word of Mouth Referral from a Friend or Colleague Event or Trade Show Walk-In / Drove By Print Advertisement Email Newsletter From Another Business Existing Client I'm Interested in the following Services: This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. SUBMIT Subscribe Get the latest marketing news and advice. First Name Last Name Email SUBSCRIBE This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. 12319 Ocean Gateway, Suite 202 Ocean City, Maryland 21842 410-213-2400 212 West Main Street Salisbury, Maryland 21801 Meet Us Testimonials Services Case Studies Videos ID3AS Blog Careers Contact Us Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions Webmail Accessibility Site Map Copyright © 2026 D3. All Rights Reserved. Website Design by D3, Ocean City MD Our Partners PREVIOUS Google YouTube Shopify Amazon Adobe Woocommerce Wordpress Bing Facebook Google YouTube Shopify Amazon Adobe Woocommerce Wordpress Bing Facebook Google NEXT",
